1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,120
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) She goes to the mall.

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:05,340
She goes inside a store.

3
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:09,020
She sees a nice skirt.

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:12,320
She takes it off the rack.

5
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,880
She touches it.

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:18,520
She goes to the fitting room.

7
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,540
She tries it on.

8
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:24,720
It fits perfectly.

9
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:28,220
She goes to the cash register.

10
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:33,460
She hands the cashier ten dollars.

11
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,680
The cashier puts the skirt in a bag.
